# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your real .env file or hardcode an API key in source files.
#
# Quickstart (Zero-Cost Prototyping):
# 1. Visit https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a Google account (no billing account required for prototyping).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms and copy your generated Demo Key.
# 4. Copy this file to .env and paste your key below.
#
# Production Setup:
# - Create a restricted key in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Geocoding API.
# - Restrict the key per:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
